ng through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The wheat came into ear nearly half a month late this year, and the ears are thin. My father farmed forty years and says he never saw the like.","zh":"今年的麦子抽穗晚了快半个月，穗子也瘪。我爹种了四十年地，说从没见过这样的。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"I want these rows hoed by noon. This afternoon I'm helping next door mend their pigsty. I promised.","zh":"我得趁上午把这几垄锄完。下午要去帮邻居家修猪圈，早就说好了的。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Every sack of grain is weighed first, and the granary takes its share before we get ours. This year, after that, we have half a sack left.","zh":"麦子收上来先过秤，交够粮仓的份才轮到自家。今年交完，家里就剩小半袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk0"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk1","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Hamo Milletford","zh":"哈莫·粟渡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"tithe.copperford-farm.farmhouse-1","x":1,"y":1},"facing":"down","props":{"age":57,"household":"tithe.copperford-farm.h0","purse":3,"favourite":"item/misc/bouquet"},"contents":["tithe.copperford-farm.folk1.coin0","tithe.copperford-farm.folk1.coin1","tithe.copperford-farm.folk1.coin2"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.cropped","face":"face.stern","beard":"beard.moustache","age":"age.lined","hat":"hat.straw","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"fair","hair":"silver","eyes":"bark","hat.1":"mustard","outfit.1":"undyed","outfit.2":"slate","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":7,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm.farmhouse-1","x":1,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm","x":38,"y":5,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm.farmhouse-1","x":2,"y":1,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm","x":38,"y":5,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm.farmhouse-1","x":2,"y":1,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"weather:rain","text":{"en":"Rain. Good. Walk round, would you, and don't step in the furrows I just opened.","zh":"下雨了，好。你绕着点走，别踩我刚开的沟。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Every sack of grain is weighed first, and the granary takes its share before we get ours. This year, after that, we have half a sack left.","zh":"麦子收上来先过秤，交够粮仓的份才轮到自家。今年交完，家里就剩小半袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Maud Milletford","zh":"莫德·粟渡"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"tithe.copperford-farm.farmhouse-1","x":2,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":40,"household":"tithe.copperford-farm.h0","purse":4,"favourite":"item/food/egg/boiled"},"contents":["tithe.copperford-farm.folk2.coin0","tithe.copperford-farm.folk2.coin1","tithe.copperford-farm.folk2.coin2","tithe.copperford-farm.folk2.coin3"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.bob","face":"face.weary","hat":"hat.kerchief","outfit":"outfit.workdress","legs":"legs.hose","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"tan","hair":"chestnut","eyes":"bark","hat.1":"umber","outfit.1":"moss","outfit.2":"ivory","legs.1":"moss","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":7,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm.farmhouse-1","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm","x":22,"y":3,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm.farmhouse-1","x":6,"y":4,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm","x":22,"y":3,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"tithe.copperford-farm","x":33,"y":16,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Oh, hello. Can I help you?","zh":"啊，你好。找我有事吗？"}},{"key":"weather:rain","text":{"en":"Rain. Good. Walk round, would you, and don't step in the furrows I just opened.","zh":"下雨了，好。你绕着点走，别踩我刚开的沟。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"I want these rows hoed by noon. This afternoon I'm helping next door mend their pigsty. I promised.","zh":"我得趁上午把这几垄锄完。下午要去帮邻居家修猪圈，早就说好了的。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The well has gone too salty to drink. We walk the better part of an hour for water now.","zh":"井水咸得没法喝了，现在挑一趟水得走大半个时辰。"}}]}}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2"}},{"id":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.copperford-farm.folk2"}}]}